morning.question:
【NULL・gettype・isset】次のPHPコードの出力はどれ？

```php
$data = [
    "name" => NULL,
    "age" => 20
];

$check = isset($data["name"]) ? "あり" : "なし";

echo gettype($data["name"]) . ":";
echo count($data) . ":" . $check;
```

